  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGAP is a global partnership of more than 30 leading development organizations that works to advance the lives of poor people through financial inclusion. Using action-oriented research, CGAP tests and shares knowledge intended to help build inclusive and responsible financial systems that move people out of poverty, protect their economic gains and advance broader development goals. CGAP&apos;s main goal is to improve access to finance for marginalized groups, where the main focus is on access to credit for women.</narrative>
  </description>
